  "description": "The ultimate e-enduro machine\nBuilt around the first ever competition e-enduro engine – the Performance Line CX Race Limited Edition motor from Bosch – and dressed in a zero compromise, maximum performance build, our top-of-the range E-180 Works is the ultimate super e-enduro race bike designed, developed and tested for – and by – the fastest riders on the fiercest courses.\n\nHighlights\n– Optimised low centre of gravity gives you untouchable gravity handling.\n– 180mm front + 170mm rear of trail-dominating suspension travel.\n– Multi-butted 6061 T-6 aluminium hydroformed frame is built to last.\n– Bosch Performance Line CX Race Limited Edition 85Nm motor (600W peak power) for game-changing race performance.\n– 750Wh battery gives you the range to get more runs in between charges.\n– MX wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear) so you can tackle everything full-gas – no matter how rowdy or steep.\n\nPeerless performance\nOur Works build is equipped with the pinnacle in high performance parts, including: SRAM’s all-new wireless XX Eagle AXS T-Type transmission for flawless shifting performance, everywhere – even under extreme load; RockShox Zeb Ultimate fork and custom tuned Super Deluxe Ultimate shock turn every mm of the travel into extra speed and traction to deliver riders the perfect balance of support, grip, confidence, and control right from the first ride; DT Swiss wheels and Maxxis tyres; SRAM Code RSC four-piston brakes with 220mm rotors for the power to control race-speeds; RaceFace and Crankbrothers finishing kit, and much more.",
